<div class="story-page full-width">
  <!-- 1. HERO SECTION: Made for Moments -->
  <section class="story-hero-section story-split-section">
    <div class="story-container">
      <div class="story-hero-grid">
        <div class="story-hero-text">
          <span class="story-label">OUR STORY</span>
          <h1 class="story-hero-title">Made for Moments.</h1>
          
          <p class="story-lead">Every meaningful moment deserves to be remembered.</p>
          <p>Whether it's the excitement of a proposal, the promise of a wedding day, the celebration of an anniversary, or a gift given with love, these are the moments that become part of our lives forever.</p>
          <p>At Arlena, we believe jewellery is more than something you wear.<br>It becomes part of your story, carrying memories that last a lifetime.</p>
          <p class="story-highlight">That's why every piece we create is Made for Moments.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="story-hero-img">
          <img src="{{ 'moments_ring_hand.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Made for Moments - Arlena Fine Jewellery" loading="lazy">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2. INSPIRED BY FAMILY (Image Left) -->
  <section class="story-split-section story-bg-white">
    <div class="story-container">
      <div class="story-split-grid">
        <div class="story-img-col">
          <img src="{{ 'moments_necklace.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Inspired by Family - Arlena" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <div class="story-text-col">
          <h2 class="story-heading">Inspired by Family.<br><span class="gold-text">Crafted in Australia.</span></h2>
          <p>Arlena was founded in Australia by a Vietnamese family inspired by timeless values of love, family and meaningful milestones.</p>
          <p>Those values continue to guide everything we create today.</p>
          <p>While our heritage shapes our values, our vision is simple—to create beautifully crafted Australian-made jewellery that celebrates life's most meaningful moments.</p>
          <p class="story-quote">Because the most treasured pieces are those that become part of the memories we share with the people we love.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3. CRAFTED WITH CARE (Image Right) -->
  <section class="story-split-section story-bg-cream">
    <div class="story-container">
      <div class="story-split-grid story-reverse">
        <div class="story-img-col">
          <img src="{{ 'handcraft_jewelry.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Crafted with Care - Arlena Master Jeweller" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <div class="story-text-col">
          <h2 class="story-heading">Crafted with <span class="gold-text">Care</span></h2>
          <p class="story-bold-sub">Every Arlena piece is individually made to order in Australia.</p>
          <p>Rather than producing jewellery in large quantities, each piece begins only after your order is placed, allowing us to focus on exceptional craftsmanship, precision and attention to detail.</p>
          <p>From carefully selected diamonds, gemstones and precious metals to the final polish and quality inspection, every stage is completed with patience and care.</p>
          <p class="story-quote">Because we believe the jewellery that marks life's most important moments deserves nothing less.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4. EXPERIENCE BEHIND EVERY PIECE -->
  <section class="story-padded-section story-bg-white text-center">
    <div class="story-container-narrow">
      <h2 class="story-heading-center">Experience Behind <span class="gold-text">Every Piece</span></h2>
      <p>At the heart of Arlena is our Master Jeweller, bringing more than 20 years of industry experience.</p>
      <p>Combining traditional craftsmanship with modern jewellery-making technology, every design is carefully overseen to ensure exceptional quality, lasting beauty and meticulous attention to detail.</p>
      <p class="story-quote-center">Every piece is inspected before leaving our workshop because true craftsmanship is found in the smallest details.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5. JEWELLERY FOR EVERY CHAPTER -->
  <section class="story-padded-section story-bg-cream story-chapters-section">
    <div class="story-container">
      <div class="chapters-header">
        <h2 class="story-heading-center">Jewellery for <span class="gold-text">Every Chapter</span></h2>
        <p class="chapters-sub">Life is filled with moments worth celebrating. Our collections are designed to become part of your journey.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="chapters-grid">
        <!-- Chapter 1 -->
        <a href="/collections/engagement-rings" class="chapter-card">
          <div class="chapter-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="34" height="34" fill="none" stroke="#b89768" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="14" r="6"/><path d="M12 3l3 3-3 3-3-3 3-3z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h4>SAY YES</h4>
          <span>Explore Engagement Rings</span>
        </a>

        <!-- Chapter 2 -->
        <a href="/collections/wedding-bands" class="chapter-card">
          <div class="chapter-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="34" height="34" fill="none" stroke="#b89768" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="15" cy="12" r="6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h4>CELEBRATE FOREVER</h4>
          <span>Explore Wedding Bands</span>
        </a>

        <!-- Chapter 3 -->
        <a href="/collections/all" class="chapter-card">
          <div class="chapter-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="34" height="34" fill="none" stroke="#b89768" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l2.5 7.5L22 12l-7.5 2.5L12 22l-2.5-7.5L2 12l7.5-2.5L12 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h4>TREASURE EVERY DAY</h4>
          <span>Explore Everyday Jewellery</span>
        </a>

        <!-- Chapter 4 -->
        <a href="/collections/all" class="chapter-card">
          <div class="chapter-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="34" height="34" fill="none" stroke="#b89768" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="8" width="18" height="13" rx="1"/><path d="M12 8v13"/><path d="M3 12h18"/><path d="M12 8C9.5 8 7 5.5 8.5 3.5 10 1.5 12 5 12 8z"/><path d="M12 8C14.5 8 17 5.5 15.5 3.5 14 1.5 12 5 12 8z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h4>GIVE WITH LOVE</h4>
          <span>Explore Gifts</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 6. OUR PROMISE (Image Left) -->
  <section class="story-split-section story-bg-white story-promise-section">
    <div class="story-container">
      <div class="story-split-grid">
        <div class="story-img-col">
          <img src="{{ 'Engagement Rings.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Our Promise - Solitaire Diamond Ring" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <div class="story-text-col">
          <h2 class="story-heading">Our <span class="gold-text">Promise</span></h2>
          <p class="promise-intro">When you choose Arlena, you're choosing more than fine jewellery.</p>
          <ul class="promise-checklist">
            <li>
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#b89768" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
              <span>Australian craftsmanship.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#b89768" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
              <span>Carefully selected materials.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#b89768" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
              <span>Thoughtfully made to order.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#b89768" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
              <span>Never mass produced.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#b89768" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
              <span>Made to celebrate life's meaningful moments.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="story-quote" style="margin-top: 25px;">Thank you for allowing Arlena to become part of your story.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 7. FOOTER TAGLINE BANNER -->
  <section class="story-tagline-banner">
    <h3>Made for Moments.</h3>
  </section>
</div>

<style>
  .story-page {
    background-color: #faf7f2;
    color: #222222;
    font-family: var(--font-base), sans-serif;
  }
  .gold-text {
    color: #b89768;
  }
  .story-container {
    max-width: 1140px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 40px;
  }
  .story-container-narrow {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 30px;
  }

  /* ═══ SPLIT SECTIONS (STANDARDIZED CONTAINER WIDTH, FLUSH VERTICAL GAP & TOP CLEARANCE) ═══ */
  .story-split-section {
    padding: 0 !important;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .story-hero-section {
    background-color: #faf7f2;
  }
  .story-hero-grid,
  .story-split-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 50px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .story-hero-text {
    padding: 140px 0 60px 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .story-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 3.5px;
    color: #777777;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 500;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .story-hero-title {
    font-family: 'Cinzel', 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 42px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: #111111;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .story-hero-text p {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #4a4a4a;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .story-lead {
    font-size: 14px !important;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #111111 !important;
  }
  .story-highlight {
    color: #b89768 !important;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .story-hero-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    min-height: 480px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: #eee7dd;
    position: relative;
  }
  .story-hero-img img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
  }

  .story-padded-section {
    padding: 85px 0;
  }
  .story-bg-white {
    background-color: #ffffff;
  }
  .story-bg-cream {
    background-color: #faf7f2;
  }
  .story-split-grid.story-reverse .story-img-col {
    order: 2;
  }
  .story-split-grid.story-reverse .story-text-col {
    order: 1;
  }
  .story-img-col {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    min-height: 460px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: #eee7dd;
    position: relative;
  }
  .story-img-col img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
  }
  .story-text-col {
    padding: 60px 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .story-heading {
    font-family: 'Cinzel', 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 30px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: #111111;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .story-bold-sub {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #111111 !important;
  }
  .story-text-col p {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #4a4a4a;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .story-quote {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #222222;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  /* Center Section */
  .text-center {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .story-heading-center {
    font-family: 'Cinzel', 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 30px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: #111111;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .story-container-narrow p {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #4a4a4a;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .story-quote-center {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #222222;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  /* Chapters Section */
  .story-chapters-section {
    padding-bottom: 95px;
  }
  .chapters-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 45px;
  }
  .chapters-sub {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #666666;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .chapters-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(184, 151, 104, 0.25);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(184, 151, 104, 0.25);
  }
  .chapter-card {
    padding: 35px 15px;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(184, 151, 104, 0.25);
  }
  .chapter-card:last-child {
    border-right: none;
  }
  .chapter-card:hover {
    background-color: #ffffff;
  }
  .chapter-icon {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .chapter-card h4 {
    font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #111111;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .chapter-card span {
    font-size: 9.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.8px;
    color: #777777;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }
  .chapter-card:hover span {
    color: #b89768;
  }

  /* Promise Checklist */
  .promise-intro {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #4a4a4a;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .promise-checklist {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 20px 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .promise-checklist li {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #333333;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .promise-checklist li svg {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* Tagline Banner */
  .story-tagline-banner {
    background-color: #ebdcd0;
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 45px 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .story-tagline-banner h3 {
    font-family: 'Cinzel', 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 991px) {
    .story-hero-grid,
    .story-split-grid,
    .story-split-grid.story-reverse {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0;
    }
    .story-hero-text {
      padding: 130px 20px 35px;
    }
    .story-text-col,
    .story-split-grid.story-reverse .story-text-col {
      padding: 35px 20px;
    }
    .story-hero-img,
    .story-img-col {
      min-height: 320px;
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
      position: relative;
    }
    .story-split-grid.story-reverse .story-img-col {
      order: 2;
    }
    .story-split-grid.story-reverse .story-text-col {
      order: 1;
    }
    .chapters-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
    .chapter-card:nth-child(2) {
      border-right: none;
    }
    .chapter-card:nth-child(1),
    .chapter-card:nth-child(2) {
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(184, 151, 104, 0.25);
    }
    .story-hero-title {
      font-size: 32px;
    }
    .story-heading,
    .story-heading-center {
      font-size: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Our Story",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
